; The small font: three rows a capital, one-pixel strokes. Same format as
; block.font. The x-height is four pixels, so an accent on a lowercase letter
; fits in the capitals' top row when it is one pixel tall, and adds half a row
; when it needs two.

cap 6
descent 2
gap 1
space 2
tracking 1

