; ---------------------------------------------------------------- cyrillic
;
; Russian, Ukrainian, Belarusian, Bulgarian, Serbian and Macedonian. A letter
; that looks the same as a Latin one is `like` it. Ё, Й, Ў, Ї, Ѓ and Ќ are not
; drawn here: they are composed from a base letter and a mark, like every
; other accented letter.

